  "filename": "27_Unit 3_Developing ideas _Reading for writing_2 Look at the and the pictures. What is the story about Now read the story and check your answer.mp3",
  "duration_ms": 117525,
  "segment_count": 18,
  "word_count": 196,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3580,
      "text": "Reading for writing. Activity too."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 4700,
      "end_ms": 9980,
      "text": "Look at the title and the pictures. What is the story about?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 11240,
      "end_ms": 14380,
      "text": "Now read the story and check your answer."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16380,
      "end_ms": 17840,
      "text": "Racing together"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 19220,
      "end_ms": 26180,
      "text": "John and Robert Taylor are brothers. They are always close to each other."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 26180,
      "end_ms": 32680,
      "text": "But Robert has a serious disease and cannot move at all."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 33620,
      "end_ms": 39080,
      "text": "He has to stay at home every day and he often feels lonely."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 40180,
      "end_ms": 42480,
      "text": "He wants to join the other kids."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 43420,
      "end_ms": 45760,
      "text": "He wants to go out and play."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47600,
      "end_ms": 51740,
      "text": "John sees Robert's sad face and wants to help."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 51740,
      "end_ms": 61060,
      "text": "One day he finds a way. He puts Robert in a trailer and pulls it along with his bike."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62500,
      "end_ms": 70320,
      "text": "For the first time, Robert feels like the other kids. A big bright smile appears on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 70320,
      "end_ms": 77160,
      "text": "his face. Now the brothers often take part in bike races"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 77160,
      "end_ms": 85820,
      "text": "together. It is hard for John to pull Robert's trailer, but John refuses to race without his"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 85820,
      "end_ms": 94080,
      "text": "brother. They don't often win, but for the brothers some things are more important than"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 94080,
      "end_ms": 101280,
      "text": "winning. They enjoy the time together. We are family, John says."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 102440,
      "end_ms": 107340,
      "text": "For the Taylor Brothers, the result doesn't really matter."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 108340,
      "end_ms": 114200,
      "text": "The love between them powers their bike and love always wins."
    }
  ],
